      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ϫⲉⲛⲥⲁϥ ⲁⲕϯⲥⲟ ⲉⲣⲟⲓ · ⲙⲡϩⲟⲟⲩ ⲇⲉ ⲙⲡⲣ**ϯⲥⲟ** ⲉⲣⲟⲓ ·",
      "english": "Yesterday thou didst spare me; to-day spare thou me not.",
      "source": "Martyrdom of Victor part 7",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:martyrdoms.victor.budge:67-85",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
